### ==========================================================
### CATEGORIES — CRUD, filtros, archivar/restaurar
### (el registro ya siembra categorías por defecto)
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar todas (éxito) — incluye las sembradas al registrarse
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar por tipo (éxito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=EXPENSE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría (éxito)
# @name createCat
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café", "emoji": "☕", "color": "BROWN", "type": "EXPENSE" }

@catId = {{createCat.response.body.id}}

### Get por id (éxito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café y snacks", "color": "AMBER" }

### Archivar (soft delete) — libera el nombre para reuso
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reusar el nombre archivado (éxito, no choca con el archivado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café y snacks", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Ver archivadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar la archivada
### (si el nombre ya lo tomó otra activa, fallará por el índice único — probar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Crear — color inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "NEON" }

### Crear — sin nombre (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emoji": "X" }
